// Input of the reliable-broadcast match (LDFI, SIGMOD 2015, §3.1): a fully connected `node` relation over the agents
// {a, b, c}, and one broadcast of the payload "data" by agent a at time 1 ("Input is a single record
// bcast(A, data)@1, along with a fully-connected node relation for the agents {A, B, C}").
// Blossom golden corpus, re-derived from the paper text (derived = true); see ../../README.md.

node("a", "b")@1;
node("a", "c")@1;
node("b", "a")@1;
node("b", "c")@1;
node("c", "a")@1;
node("c", "b")@1;

bcast("a", "data")@1;
